The exported `ManuscriptPublisher` coordinates an optional cover upload and manuscript storage. `publish` must trim `title`, reject an empty result with `Error("Title must not be empty")`, and leave its input untouched. When `coverBytes` is absent, it must save the existing `coverToken`. When present, it must copy the bytes before passing them to `BinaryDepot.put`, await the returned token, and save that new token. The object passed to `ManuscriptStore.save` must not contain `coverBytes`. Return a copy of the saved record. Dependency errors propagate unchanged.

